<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS1.SSS0.Px3" title="In F.1 Embodied Agentic Workflow ‣ Appendix F Prompt Context ‣ The Bitter Lesson of Diffusion Language Models for Agentic Workflows: A Comprehensive Reality Check" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DiffuAgent: EarlyExit</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A6.SS2" title="In Appendix F Prompt Context ‣ The Bitter Lesson of Diffusion Language Models for Agentic Workflows: A Comprehensive Reality Check" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F.2 </span>Tool-Calling Agentic Workflow</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS2.SSS0.Px1" title="In F.2 Tool-Calling Agentic Workflow ‣ Appendix F Prompt Context ‣ The Bitter Lesson of Diffusion Language Models for Agentic Workflows: A Comprehensive Reality Check" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Tool-Calling Prompt</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In F.2 Tool-Calling Agentic Workflow ‣ Appendix F Prompt Context ‣ The Bitter Lesson of Diffusion Language Models for Agentic Workflows: A Comprehensive Reality Check" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DiffuAgent: Tool Selector</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A6.SS2.SSS0.Px3" title="In F.2 Tool-Calling Agentic Workflow ‣ Appendix F Prompt Context ‣ The Bitter Lesson of Diffusion Language Models for Agentic Workflows: A Comprehensive Reality Check" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">DiffuAgent: Too-Call Editor</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
