<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span><span id="S3.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison of Success Rate (%) and Progress Rate (%)</span> across different <span id="S3.T1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#BF0000;">LLMs</span> and
<span id="S3.T1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#008000;">dLLMs</span> on three <span id="S3.T1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Embodied</span> tasks. Best results are highlighted in <span id="S3.T1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. The lower-right fluctuation values indicate the variability estimated from 3 runs, showing the possible effect of error propagation.</figcaption>
</figure>
