</span></span>
<span id="A6.T11.2.4.3.1.1.2.18.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
<span id="A6.T11.2.4.3.1.1.2.18.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:325.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T11.2.4.3.1.1.2.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">In front of you in this room, you can see several objects: There is a grey box 1 3 steps in front of you and 1 steps to your left. There is a grey ball 1 2 steps in front of you and 2 steps to your left. There is a red ball 1 right in front of you 5 steps away. There is a grey key 1 4 steps in front of you and 1 steps to your left. The room has walls around you. You are facing a wall 6 steps away. You are not carrying anything.</span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A6.T11.2.4.3.1.1.2.19" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A6.T11.2.4.3.1.1.2.19.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:0.75pt;padding-bottom:0.75pt;">
