<td id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Hey, I’ve just filled my car up with 13.2 gallons of fuel. How much is that in liters?</span>
</span></td></tr>
