</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.15.4.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">Once you’ve converted it to liters, please guide me in filling the tank to the max limit. After that’s sorted, I need to ensure that all the doors are securely locked and the parking brake is firmly set.</span>
</span></td></tr>
