</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">[lockDoors(unlock=True, door=["driver", "passenger", "rear_left", "rear_right"])], [lockDoors(unlock=False, door=["driver", "passenger", "rear_left", "rear_right"])]</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left"><span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">U:</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding:-0.25pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">I mean could you help me get all those doors unlocked? It’d be fantastic if you could also switch on the headlights. It’s getting a bit darker out here than expected, and visibility’s not great!</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T12.2.17.3.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
