<span id="A6.T12.2.18.3.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.18.3.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">It’d be great if you could pop Zeta Corp’s stock onto my watchlist. I’ve come across some fascinating insights into their recent performance that I want to monitor.</span>
</span></td></tr>
