<span id="A6.T12.2.18.3.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:329.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T12.2.18.3.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_left">With Zeta Corp’s stock now on my radar, let’s pull up the complete list of stocks I’m watching. I want to double-check that all my chosen stocks are properly listed for my review.</span>
</span></td></tr>
